<title>USA: Dow suffers eighth-largest point loss.</title>
<headline>Dow suffers eighth-largest point loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average closed unofficially down 148.36 points to 6391.69 on Friday. If official, the drop would mark the eigth-largest single-day point loss in New York Stock Exchange history.</p>
<p>Prior to Friday, the following were the days with the largest osses:</p>
